{"OptiFG (Upscaler)":{"translation":"OptiFG（升频器）","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"e8d691a8b21638b8b9e90728c2509d55ad07821e0749d662784e4ef2eee3a922"},"Output ratio":{"translation":"输出比例","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ef781d3394e902c56b42614aa1128e1c17b021ff4e8af3d1b3c75ef6abfe14e9"},"Output size":{"translation":"输出尺寸","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"9a2974093895bda72db6d28af1d2e36db668ee29dee0e9fe0905f9cee2b34cf1"},"Override the detected graphics API for this game.\n\nAuto uses the auto-detected value from PE header scanning.\nUser overrides set here take precedence over manifest and auto-detected values.\nReset Overrides reverts to auto-detection.":{"translation":"覆盖为此游戏检测到的图形 API。\n\n自动：使用 PE 头扫描得到的自动检测值。\n此处设置的用户覆盖优先于清单和自动检测值。\n“重置覆盖”会恢复为自动检测。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"437c4c2ca65456a1ad5d6868c143ca40ac2e8541b86bd774216777a99e36f3a6"},"Override the DLSS upscaling model. J/K use the 1st-gen transformer (DLSS 4.0). L/M use the 2nd-gen transformer (DLSS 4.5) with better temporal stability. NVIDIA Recommended uses NVIDIA's per-resolution preset selection.":{"translation":"覆盖 DLSS 升频模型。J/K 使用第一代 Transformer（DLSS 4.0）；L/M 使用第二代 Transformer（DLSS 4.5），时间稳定性更好。“NVIDIA 推荐”会使用 NVIDIA 按分辨率选择的预设。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"fd556ef6041d8352141327d25332ac64d546e05fa6f59ed6f6cf1406bf1216c4"},"Override the Frame Generation interpolation model. Higher presets are newer model iterations. NVIDIA Recommended uses NVIDIA's per-resolution preset selection.":{"translation":"覆盖帧生成插值模型。更高的预设代表更新的模型迭代。“NVIDIA 推荐”会使用 NVIDIA 按分辨率选择的预设。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"19da8696155fed2439d232daa1ef022a1abb29303146b1b985208e63a87bf93f"},"Override the Ray Reconstruction denoising model. Higher presets are newer model iterations. NVIDIA Recommended uses NVIDIA's per-resolution preset selection.":{"translation":"覆盖光线重建降噪模型。更高的预设代表更新的模型迭代。“NVIDIA 推荐”会使用 NVIDIA 按分辨率选择的预设。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"620f2f4ccf749f4e638d1dc119ef4523b5db7d0b4f26130b34866157f635ceea"},"