7bcd3434c00b21b6ca1430309843e"},"Writes r.DefaultFeature.AntiAliasing=2 and r.PostProcessAAQuality=4 to Engine.ini.\nForces TAA with high quality for Luma HDR compatibility.":{"translation":"向 Engine.ini 写入 r.DefaultFeature.AntiAliasing=2 和 r.PostProcessAAQuality=4。\n强制使用高质量 TAA，以兼容 Luma HDR。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"e428f78dc5f0c93b757f8c43d45877ba49e0801556b3395c9a7f6b252bb11b98"},"X":{"translation":"X","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"4b68ab3847feda7d6c62c1fbcbeebfa35eab7351ed5e78f4ddadea5df64b8015"},"XeFG":{"translation":"XeFG","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"10bed329a00ed320a2649441a62549477d1ce7c6293e7538e6b5188078ac14b1"},"Zip the currently selected shader files and copy the archive to your clipboard. Paste directly into Discord to share.":{"translation":"将当前选中的着色器文件打包为 ZIP 并复制到剪贴板，可直接粘贴到 Discord 进行分享。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"33b31fed0f76fdd8225352367e40e4e88fb9d8d9e7a0c32e10cafa385c145ab7"}}